    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates are delighted to present 16 Birchwood Close to the market. This 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom terraced home offers a spacious accommodation throughout and is ideally positioned in Dublin 24.\n\nUpon entering, the property briefly comprises of a entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining area, a utility and a sunroom to the rear of the kitchen. Upstairs there is 3 comfortable size bedrooms with the main family bathroom. \n\nBright and spacious throughout this property offers a comfortable layout with the potential for the new owner to put their own stamp on the property and create a comfortable and welcoming home.\n\nThis property benefits from front garden and a low maintenance rear garden.\n\nThis property is within a short distance of Tallaght Village where there is easy access to public transport and all local amenities & is within a stones throw away from all local amenities including Supervalu, the Red Luas line, restaurants, N7 & M50 providing easy access to Dublin City Centre, The Square Shopping Centre, Citywest Business Park & Shopping Centre & Tallaght Hospital. There is also an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools in the area.\n\nAn ideal opportunity for First time buyers to step onto the property ladder. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing!\n\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n\n\n"
      },
      {
